{"articleNo":"1009","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1009&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 수시합격생을 위한 예비대학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.16","hit":"15001","attachments":[{"name":"예비대학 강의계획서(물리).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1009&attachNo=69274"},{"name":"2009년 예비대학 강좌 운영계획서(수학)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1009&attachNo=69275"},{"name":"인사말(공지).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1009&attachNo=70283"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">예비대학에 대한 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">금오공과대학교 2010학년도 수시 모집에 합격한 학생을 대상으로 아래와 같이 공과대학에서 기초로 하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">기초교과목에 대하여 예비대학을 실시하오니 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">.<br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><img height=\"72\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/file/upload/Image/preuniv.jpg\" width=\"275\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">1. 개설 교과목 : 기초수학, 기초물리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\">2. 교육기간 : 2010. 1. 18(월) ~ 1. 22(금)[5일간 : 과목당 1일 3시간 수업]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">시&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 간</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">교 과 목</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"129\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">내&nbsp;&nbsp; 용</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">비&nbsp; 고</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">09:30 ~ 12:30</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">기초수학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"129\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">1 ~ 3교시</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">5개반 200명 기준</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">12:30 ~ 13:30</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">-</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"129\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">점심시간</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">13:30 ~ 16:30</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">기초물리</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"129\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">4 ~ 6교시</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\" height=\"27\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">3개반 120명 기준</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 수학, 물리과목을 선택하여 수강할 수 있음.(둘다가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">3. 강사진 : 본 대학교 교수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4. 교육내용 : 대학의 공학교육에 필요한 기초 수학 및 물리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 강의 계획서는 첨부파일 참조.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">5. 교육장소 : 본 대학교 강의실(추후 공지)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">6. 비용 :&nbsp; 무료(교재 및 중식&nbsp; 포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">7. 신청방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">신청기간 : 2009. 12. 23(수) ~ 2010. 1. 5(화)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 98.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font color=\"#3366ff\">신청방법 : 웹으로만 신청 가능.[본교홈페이지→팝업 5번→자세히보러가기 클릭→신청하러가기 클릭→ 신청서 작성→저장]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 98.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">8. 대상자 선정 : 계획된 인원보다 신청학생이 많을 경우 본 대학교 자체지침에 의거 수강대상자를 선발함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">9. 특&nbsp; 전</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 소정의 강좌를 80%이상 출석한 학생에 대하여 수료증과 기념품을 교부함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 우수한 출석률을 기록한 학생에 대하여 소정의 상품을 지급함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 대구지역 학생을 위한 통학버스 운행(구미시내는 순환버스 운행 예정)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 대구외 지역 및 희망학생을 위한 생활관 제공 : 무료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12.4pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 조/석 식비는 본인 부담)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">10. 문의처 : 금오공과대학교 교무연구과 학사관리팀(☎054-478-7027)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 (☎054-478-7948)</span></p>\n&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
